# Attestations are local by default; list deliberate versioned files literally.
# Keep this list aligned when selected reviews, admitted journals, or summaries change.
# criterion-reviews/ is a required gate input (CriterionReviewData reads it at runtime), so the
# image keeps it even if Git does not track it (Windows path-length limit, plan standards P).
# Wildcard negations disable BuildKit directory pruning and walk ignored local state.
